    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594b43cf85d985d9fe4e270b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "挣脱名为常识的枷锁，\n去进行甚至不惜削减灵魂般的、\n更深层次的自我逼迫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b624ec9002464a8c25b4487266d162b0ca02446b1717f04f32b408e9277e0076",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
