    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f18f58cda44305f1753ca44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63f5a995b4476553c343d886",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这也是为了让这副躯体得以抵达『异世界』的、\n崇高之仪式――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f02416f547dfd27769c08a6bce32f6465483671d3d112faa2bc058225de575",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317a44313cfb52f9dd7c6152",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95db2e153eddbe76375d1263",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "令人惊讶的是，红色梦想竟然主动提出，\n希望进行施加更大负荷的极限加训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8045c2e2b3c00e5e7f734c1812039dda522187421543172096c575ebecdeb4a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f22d8caa5f3e0d567eaa80f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎战秋华赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "7795c6ae2b1596388c64603306de74b17597275345677949808e5ff995683669",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de77be1242200dc8fc56616",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想在『秋华赏』上展现出的\n奔跑姿态，给整个比赛界带来了巨大的轰动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb8a4abb77e646490186503bd78ace1bcf8a71a7f74efbf07bfae3be60246763",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff68bb52d6ce33b8d02a67d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "斩获了无上辉光的圣女，将下一个目标定在了……\n开创时代的强者们齐聚一堂的『日本杯』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ca15fbb88798a6c4702bbac97e01924e59e3e1cc03728b8fba99a60ba9e64e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8070b1ada87af03ea2c1aeb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而那位大人，不是别人。 \n正是她格外仰慕与思念着的伏特加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9479e70bcadeb1d599efc2efcce9b7a4d3582180af925fa533edfd7525db70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d22af0f48c0edd3d6ee8c66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd8c6aa999fff8e233679df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊……没曾想，真是没曾想！ \n竟然能够与伏特加小姐，在如此宏大的舞台上 \n并肩同台……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd53485defcc17bac7a3c986aa8f9e171aa56bb0cc0b1eb63aa493a509721e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b669f014cf4fd23e1c8c8869",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd184a872b9ab1bca2d988f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仅仅是脑海中浮现出那个画面， \n我这副身躯里所寄宿的神圣玛那， \n就仿佛快要满溢喷发出来了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e45363005c036aa3833e14ff044b9420ac060bcf8b26c81fbeb133809e8acc9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4283a656b411e8144d1f7efe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――她显得过于欢欣雀跃了。 \n这让我的心中不禁掠过了一丝不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a34c92f30773b12a74d89656766230a4c1b7ecb2c4b9c9f07e83feb857712ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:246348d9f8bfc75bc16f198c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在『日本杯』上汇聚的强者， \n可绝不仅仅只有伏特加一人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db1ae44a240c686e42bb7c8197e590aa61f4fce121c859ef949d1b48aa6b206d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d772e267c8b737249719b1cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "上至像伏特加这样处于古马级的资深老将， \n下至在经典级一直驰骋于三冠路线上的 \n一众实力派选手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b296df84a6b25e5ca26455b2929c2e3642c9b53f60ae5eb7f635f031cd85eda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ca4cfc013e6c949eab04fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅如此，这更是海外的猛将们齐聚一堂的 \n顶级赛事。这就注定了，它将会成为一场\n前所未有的严酷试炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7320f288a5f435bee5bcd95139f033b9aff01252442a0fa317165d6ca7f8a7f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b3999cd34f7a26ab5784ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦想……我，下一次也想让你赢",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a58366449f8f69f0292c49d9e5e169e5eeba68f1bc4b9fa0f7bbdbdaa77008",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61e4f27b678bb484b99af170",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦想……我，下一次也想让您赢",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09a52e0b6b2684c911a990f3e76b8a61ba0e0ed64375176b31a3eda297860a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b113c822481ce6417fbb7ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――如果是这般飘飘然的话， \n绝对无法染指胜利的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93776bc1d0c0904f2ebd8538cfd9925f1727db74e66c1cd3665f50a870c5d90c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0442d97e73c175cf6153e366",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc0247c9c99f18a9d4a983e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵……我心里很清楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f48fda4f26aa46e1886c07fd72b9999e8bf77a5912d759fe0d33d8608928adf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e77101797d7e1f051a0e870b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d7ac6b92baee5851789a701",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我并不是，为了单纯去崇拜伏特加小姐 \n才奔赴这场『日本杯』的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b96dc72766d64786785a1e24df82f8e3a99e2cf2ec1bed5adb932b9f0a1161",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41c1a0e83c69d04d806fc401",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以及，君临那片赛场之上的、\n她所憧憬的马娘――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5071570f89d7ed4853cb18108b06ca6e72bdde3543c91e44a8139b635da9d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b40ce0d452a98dffa0f2bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a24d546c40c27c4be30a7d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那道让我憧憬、仰慕、敬爱的耀眼背影， \n我要用我的这双脚，将其彻底击碎―― \n并以此为目标直指异世界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2ae36a5dde0e9d9656ca091eb5e9b67fa7b099264eee6e708b94628a1fae3d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e783fb88fb01360b765b94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
