      "uid": "zhcn:e2662093501c56298789bbf9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正如她所宣言的那样，在那之后的训练中， \n展现出了远超以往的凄绝与凝练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce53fd0de5c1b9099d03c9358b2f1496c04e3880c6149988e7c78e83a047bfe9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
